Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.28,0:22:19.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur10}若問我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:22.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur10}內心雖總如鉛沉重
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.49,0:22:22.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur10}內心雖總如鉛沉重
